<% provide(:title, "Accessibility Statement (RGAA 4.1)") %>

<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <h1 class="mb-2">Accessibility Statement</h1>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">
        ShareMyBag is committed to making its web application accessible in accordance with the French <strong>RGAA 4.1</strong> standard and <strong>WCAG 2.1 Level AA</strong> guidelines.
      </p>

      <section class="smb-card p-4 mb-4" aria-labelledby="a11y-status-heading">
        <h2 id="a11y-status-heading" class="h5 mb-2">Compliance status</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
          This interface has been designed and verified against the core criteria of <strong>RGAA 4.1 (Level AA)</strong>, covering semantic structure, color contrast, keyboard navigation, accessible forms, and assistive technology announcements.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="smb-card p-4 mb-4" aria-labelledby="a11y-measures-heading">
        <h2 id="a11y-measures-heading" class="h5 mb-2">Key accessibility measures implemented</h2>
        <ul class="text-muted mb-0 ps-3">
          <li class="mb-2"><strong>Document structure & landmarks (RGAA 8 & 12):</strong> explicit <code>lang="en"</code>, unique page titles, skip link to main content, ARIA landmarks (<code>banner</code>, <code>navigation</code>, <code>main</code>, <code>contentinfo</code>), single <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> and strict heading hierarchy.</li>
          <li class="mb-2"><strong>Color contrast (RGAA 3.2 & 3.3):</strong> text contrast ≥ 4.5:1 across all body text, badges, and buttons; UI control border contrast ≥ 3:1; information never conveyed by color alone.</li>
          <li class="mb-2"><strong>Keyboard navigation & focus (RGAA 10.7):</strong> 100% keyboard-operable workflows with high-contrast <code>:focus-visible</code> indicators and full support for <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>.</li>
          <li class="mb-2"><strong>Accessible forms (RGAA 11):</strong> explicit <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> bindings, logical <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code>/<code>&lt;legend&gt;</code> groupings, <code>aria-required</code>, <code>aria-invalid</code>, <code>autocomplete</code> hints, and focusable <code>role="alert"</code> error summaries.</li>
          <li><strong>Dynamic updates (RGAA 7):</strong> live total price estimates, status banners, and code-copy confirmations announced politely via <code>aria-live</code> regions.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="smb-card p-4" aria-labelledby="a11y-feedback-heading">
        <h2 id="a11y-feedback-heading" class="h5 mb-2">Feedback and continuous improvement</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
          Automated RGAA structural checks run continuously in our test suite. If you encounter any accessibility barrier while using ShareMyBag, please report it through our repository issue tracker so we can resolve it promptly.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
